Well, I did it with;

AoLS with AoR and AoMB as swap item
GDSM
SoReflection
CoDisplacement (with oilskin as a swap item)
BoSpeed (with wwalking and levitation as swap items)
GoDex
Magicbane

To be frank, with both the PYEC and Magicbane, I barely needed the GDSM;
the odds of getting both Rodney stealing the PYEC and a bullwhip stealing
Magicbane would be very small. I would have done better to use SDSM and
carried a CoMR I could swap in if I lost either of the MR items; then I
could have made more active use of spells, which would have been very
helpful on the Astral Plane. I could still have used a small shield for
AC and had a 0% fail on charm monster, which is what I needed most.

Also, although I had BoLev, I left them on DL 1. I'd planned to use PoLev
on Air in order to keep my speed, but this then presented a problem on
Water; I donned my AoMB and stuffed my BoH into my oilskin sack, and hoped
that the levitation wouldn't wear off. It didn't; but I guess the note for
next time is to remember to _bring_ all the AK. :-)
